#. DB-IP bullet
#: readme.txt:dbip-bullet-privacy
msgid "DB-IP Privacy Policy: https://db-ip.com/privacy.php"
msgstr "DB-IP:s integritetspolicy: https://db-ip.com/privacy.php"

#. DB-IP bullet
#: readme.txt:dbip-bullet-license
